5":-0.0124,"r20":0.0664,"r1_spy":-0.0339,"r5_spy":-0.0159,"r20_spy":0.0724}}],"quotes":[{"c":"UGI 2019 Q4","e":"ugi","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted J. Jastrzebski","x":"Roger will speak to this in more detail in a few moments, but with the buying behind us, we're in a position to make a series of investments at AmeriGas' that will provide consistent and sustained cost savings and operating efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/ugi-corp-ugi-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2019 Q4","e":"ugi","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted J. Jastrzebski","x":"In 2020, we will see the impact from the rate case that Utilities and a more modest impact from cost saving and efficiency measures at our LPG businesses and the incremental margin from the CMG acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/ugi-corp-ugi-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q1","e":"ugi","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John L Walsh","x":"As those new rates went into effect in October, we also made significant progress on the major restructuring programs across our LPG line of business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/ugi-corp-ugi-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q1","e":"ugi","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John L Walsh","x":"Our teams did an exceptional job executing, as we managed our supply chain to optimize margin and saw the positive impact of our restructuring programs on operating expenses, all while maintaining high levels of service to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/ugi-corp-ugi-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q2","e":"ugi","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Perreault","x":"As we continue to develop our tools to streamline processes, we will use the learnings from our COVID-19 experience to shape our path forward as we seek to be more efficient and improve the customer experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/ugi-corp-ugi-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q2","e":"ugi","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thaddeus J. Jastrzebski","x":"We remain on track and will meet or exceed the commitments that we laid out for fiscal 2020 cost savings from these initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/ugi-corp-ugi-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John L. Walsh","x":"We delivered strong results as a combination of colder than normal weather, rigorous expense and margin management, and the positive contributions of our LPG restructuring programs underpin strong earnings, cash flow and liquidity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/ugi-corp-ugi-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted J. Jastrzebski","x":"We expect to realize the full EUR5 million in P&L savings in fiscal '20 and are on track to deliver the full EUR30 million in cost savings by the end of fiscal '22.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/ugi-corp-ugi-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2020-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John L. Walsh","x":"We're very pleased with our strong third quarter performance and increased our full-year guidance to a range of $2.45 to $2.55.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/ugi-corp-ugi-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2020 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2020-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John L. Walsh","x":"Our increased guidance is one indicator of that strength and resilience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/ugi-corp-ugi-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UGI 2021 Q2","e":"ugi","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John L. Walsh","x":"So it's a variety of actions and proactive efforts that enabled us to increase guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/ugi-corp-ugi-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UGI 2021 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Marc Joseph Solecitto","x":"I know part of the strategy was to share some of your cost savings with customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/ugi-corporation-ugi-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"UGI 2021 Q4","e":"ugi","d":"2021-11-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted J. Jastrzebski","x":"This includes benefits from the business transformation initiatives as well as the return to normal weather in the U.S. In establishing our guidance, we've taken into consideration some impact from inflation, supply chain constraints and commodity price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/19/ugi-corporation-ugi-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"UGI 2025 Q3","e":"ugi","d":"2025-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean O'Brien","x":"Lastly, I am pleased with the progress made in optimizing our LPG portfolio, generating approximately $150 million in cash proceeds while streamlining our footprint, enhancing our strategic focus, and providing meaningful support for our deleveraging objectives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/ugi-ugi-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UGI 2026 Q2","e":"ugi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Flexon","x":"We are rolling this out in a phased approach across the markets where we currently operate AmeriGas' cylinder home delivery service called Cynch, leveraging our established direct-to-consumer d